{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"subheading":"","show_title":true,"heading_font_size":"heading-large","show_content":true,"text_font_size":"body-medium","align_text":"text-left","width":"wrapper","color_scheme":"","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":50,"heading_tag":"automatic"}},"contact_form_RbQx3F":{"type":"contact-form","blocks":{"text_LHbPJQ":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"Nom et Prénom","required":false}},"email_et3PQB":{"type":"email","settings":{"title":"Email","required":true}},"body_GQQkEX":{"type":"body","settings":{"title":"Message","required":true}}},"block_order":["text_LHbPJQ","email_et3PQB","body_GQQkEX"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Contactez-nous 🤍","heading_font_size":"heading-large","terms":true,"width":"wrapper--narrow","color_scheme":"","padding_top":100,"padding_bottom":100,"heading_tag":"automatic"}},"section_hero_XebRPi":{"type":"section-hero","name":"Image banner","settings":{"image_2":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DSC7283.jpg","link":"shopify:\/\/products\/anzieu","width":"wrapper--full","height":"screen-height-three-quarters","flex_align_desktop":"align--middle-center-desktop","content_width":50,"mobile_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DSC7190.jpg","mobile_height":"image-height--mobile","flex_align_mobile":"align--middle-center-mobile","color_scheme":"","show_text_background":false,"overlay_type":"disabled","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":50,"show_placeholder":true}},"section_rich_text_P3Y8BT":{"type":"section-rich-text","blocks":{"heading_8imQrc":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"DEVENIR(S)","heading_font_size":"heading-large","padding_bottom":16,"heading_tag":"automatic"}},"subheading_CENNHg":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"subheading":"ACT 1 : LE RETOUR","padding_bottom":16}},"text_prwBdn":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Tu connais forcément ce petit coup de stress du matin. Tu as la tenue qui fonctionne, tu attrapes tes affaires à la va-vite et, juste avant de partir, ton regard s’arrête sur le sac. <\/p>","text_font_size":"body-medium","padding_bottom":16}},"accordion_cbVxiH":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"text":"<p>Tu sais que tu dois prendre ton ordinateur au cas où la journée décide de ne pas respecter le programme. <br\/>- ton ordinateur qui fini dans un totebag dans le métro, <br\/>- La réflexion “tu viens de quitter le travail ?”. <br\/>Et surtout, tu sais déjà que tu vas perdre dix minutes à fouiller au fond pour retrouver tes clés, ton téléphone ou ton hydratant à lèvres.<\/p>","text_font_size":"body-medium","button_open_text":"En savoir plus","button_close_text":"Voir moins","padding_bottom":16}}},"block_order":["heading_8imQrc","subheading_CENNHg","text_prwBdn","accordion_cbVxiH"],"name":"Rich text","settings":{"align_text":"text-center","width":"wrapper","color_scheme":"","overlay_type":"disabled","padding_top":100,"padding_bottom":100}},"section_custom_content_dEW4X6":{"type":"section-custom-content","blocks":{"text_image_Rpk8KK":{"type":"text_image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DSC7295.jpg","image_width":370,"image_ratio":"0.75","subheading":"","title":"","heading_font_size":"heading-medium","text":"","text_font_size":"body-small","align_text":"text-center","button_text":"","button_url":"shopify:\/\/products\/anzieu","button_type":"btn--primary","button_size":"","button_style":"btn--outline","show_arrow":false,"bg_color":"","color":"","heading_tag":"automatic"}},"image_bJCTaz":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DSC7137.jpg","title":"","heading_font_size":"heading-large","text":"","text_font_size":"body-medium","flex_align":"align--middle-center","show_text_background":false,"bg_color":"","color":"","overlay_type":"disabled","link_text":"","link":"shopify:\/\/products\/anzieu","button_type":"btn--primary","button_size":"","button_style":"btn--solid","show_arrow":false,"heading_tag":"automatic"}}},"block_order":["text_image_Rpk8KK","image_bJCTaz"],"name":"Custom section","settings":{"borders":false,"gutters":false,"width":"wrapper--full","height":"screen-height-full","mobile_height":"screen-height-one-half--mobile","reverse_blocks":false,"color_scheme":"","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":50}},"section_rich_text_pADdLn":{"type":"section-rich-text","blocks":{"heading_8cd8hR":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"L'intelligence qui allège l'esprit","heading_font_size":"heading-large","padding_bottom":16,"heading_tag":"automatic"}},"text_jVJd9W":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Parce que l'assurance passe par le confort, Anzieu a été conçu pour être d'une légèreté absolue à vide. Il prend soin de ton épaule comme de ton esprit grâce à une architecture intérieure pensée pour la vraie vie :<\/p>","text_font_size":"body-medium","padding_bottom":16}},"columns_3_kgbwi9":{"type":"columns_3","settings":{"heading_font_size":"heading-x-small","text_font_size":"body-medium","column_1_title":"Un compartiment central flottant","column_1_text":"<p>Ton ordinateur se glisse à l'arrière en toute sécurité, tandis que l'avant reste souple pour accueillir ta journée. Même rempli, sa structure géométrique reste impeccablement intacte.<\/p>","column_2_title":"Une organisation qui t'apaise","column_2_text":"<p>Des poches intérieures bien pensées pour que chaque objet retrouve sa place naturelle, sans que tu aies besoin d'y penser.<\/p>","column_3_title":"Le système de portée modulable","column_3_text":"<p>Un jeu de crochets et d'anneaux dissimulés te permet de passer d'un porté épaule ajusté à un porté bandoulière court ou poignet, toujours avec le même équilibre visuel.<\/p>","button_open_text":"En savoir plus","button_close_text":"Voir moins","padding_bottom":16}}},"block_order":["heading_8cd8hR","text_jVJd9W","columns_3_kgbwi9"],"name":"Rich text","settings":{"align_text":"text-center","width":"wrapper","color_scheme":"","overlay_type":"disabled","padding_top":100,"padding_bottom":0}},"section_multicolumn_876BTJ":{"type":"section-multicolumn","blocks":{"text_